---
config:
  theme: default
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 1
description: >-
  one representative requirement diagram, hand-drawn in the default theme (D319): the box
  outlines and dividers sketched through w.outline, the relation lines through the edge
  outline, the markers and text plain (D301)
---
requirementDiagram

  requirement test_req {
    id: 1
    text: the test text.
    risk: high
    verifymethod: test
  }

  functionalRequirement test_req2 {
    id: 1.1
    text: the second test text.
    risk: low
    verifymethod: inspection
  }

  performanceRequirement test_req3 {
    id: 1.2
    text: the third test text.
    risk: medium
    verifymethod: demonstration
  }

  element test_entity {
    type: simulation
  }

  element test_entity2 {
    type: word doc
    docRef: reqs/test_entity
  }

  test_entity - satisfies -> test_req2
  test_req - traces -> test_req2
  test_req - contains -> test_req3
  test_entity2 - verifies -> test_req
